# Bundled ACME client for the Mikrozia container image.
#
# Format: <local-archive> <source-url> <sha256>
#
# The ACME client is an immutable image build input: the build downloads
# exactly this URL and fails closed unless the SHA-256 of the downloaded bytes
# matches. The URL is pinned to an upstream commit, so it can never change
# under Mikrozia, and no mutable release channel (`releases/latest`, a moving
# tag) is allowed here. The runtime invokes only the copy baked into the image;
# it never downloads, installs, or updates the client itself.
#
# Updating: pick a new upstream commit, download the archive, record its
# SHA-256 here, and re-verify the image build.
#
# acmesh-official/acme.sh — ACME client used for HTTP-01 and DNS-01 issuance.
